[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489676954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112409#issuecomment-3489676954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112409","id":3489676954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QAD6a","user":{"login":"TranquilMarmot","id":504259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDI1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot","html_url":"https://github.com/TranquilMarmot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T07:08:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T07:11:33Z","body":"Ah! I am just \"holding it wrong\"\n\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_physicsrayqueryparameters3d.html#class-physicsrayqueryparameters3d-property-exclude\n\n> The list of object [RID](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_rid.html#class-rid)s that will be excluded from collisions. Use [CollisionObject3D.get_rid()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_collisionobject3d.html#class-collisionobject3d-method-get-rid) to get the [RID](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_rid.html#class-rid) associated with a [CollisionObject3D](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_collisionobject3d.html#class-collisionobject3d)-derived node.\n\nSo passing in a `Node3D` here is actually bad behavior and _should_ fail.\n\n---\n\nNot sure if this issue is meaningful or if this is expected behavior - feel free to close it","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489676954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489970202","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112409#issuecomment-3489970202","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112409","id":3489970202,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QBLga","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T08:45:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:45:16Z","body":"> Passing in the plain object should work here, right?\n\nIn general no, a Resource ID (RID) is not the same as a Node or an Object. There are just some functions around physics that when an object is passed to them they try to use the get_rid() function on that object behind the scene so it \"magically\" works to pass the wrong parameter type while it actually shouldnt.\n\n> But as far as I know, you're never really supposed to interact with RIDs from GDScript directly?\n\nYou interact with RIDs from GDScript all the time because that is what you use for nearly all server related functions.\n\nFor some engine features you just may be able to never use RIDs and still get the job done because they have all those RIDs wrapped inside Nodes and Resources objects as an abstraction. For some engine features there is not a single Node or Resource available so your only option is to use RIDs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489970202/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490315240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112409#issuecomment-3490315240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112409","id":3490315240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QCfvo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T10:08:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T10:08:41Z","body":"Closing as this is not a bug and the documentation and errors are both clear on what is the issue","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490315240/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]